\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/saintmaud-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\\/\\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/saintmaud-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/saintmaud-80x80.jpeg 80w, https:\\/\\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/saintmaud-180x180.jpeg 180w, https:\\/\\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/saintmaud-60x60.jpeg 60w, https:\\/\\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/saintmaud.jpeg 1080w\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\talt=\\\"\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\ttitle=\\\"saintmaud\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tclass=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-featured-image\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\twidth=\\\"1080\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\theight=\\\"1080\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\/>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-details tribe-common-g-col\\\">\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<header class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-header\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h4 class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-title tribe-common-h6 tribe-common-h4--min-medium\\\">\\n\\t<a\\n\\t\\thref=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/event\\/feminist-fightback-filmclub-presents-tbc-8\\/\\\"\\n\\t\\ttitle=\\\"Feminist Fightback Filmclub presents: Saint Maud\\\"\\n\\t\\trel=\\\"bookmark\\\"\\n\\t\\tclass=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\\\"\\n\\t>\\n\\t\\tFeminist Fightback Filmclub presents: Saint Maud\\t<\\/a>\\n<\\/h4>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime-wrapper tribe-common-b2\\\">\\n\\t\\t<time class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime\\\" datetime=\\\"2026-10-23\\\">\\n\\t\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-event-date-start\\\">October 23 @ 7:00 pm<\\/span> - <span class=\\\"tribe-event-time\\\">10:00 pm<\\/span>\\t<\\/time>\\n\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<address class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue tribe-common-b2\\\">\\n\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue-title tribe-common-b2--bold\\\">\\n\\t\\tPeople's Letters Bookshop\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue-address\\\">\\n\\t\\t395 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London, United Kingdom\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t<\\/address>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/header>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-description tribe-common-b2 tribe-common-a11y-hidden\\\">\\n\\t<p>Join us this October for a horror film! We will be screening Saint Maud (1h 24min), directed by Rose Glass. The film follows Maud, a religious hospice nurse assigned to [&hellip;]<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n<\\/li>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t\\t<nav class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list-nav tribe-events-c-nav\\\" aria-label=\\\"Bottom events list pagination\\\">\\n\\t<ul class=\\\"tribe-events-c-nav__list\\\">\\n\\t\\t<li class=\\\"tribe-events-c-nav__list-item tribe-events-c-nav__list-item--prev\\\">\\n\\t<a\\n\\t\\thref=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.feministfightback.org.uk\\/events\\/category\\/feminist-fightback-film-club\\/list\\/?eventDisplay=past\\\"\\n\\t\\trel=\\\"prev\\\"\\n\\t\\tclass=\\\"tribe-events-c-nav__prev tribe-common-b2 tribe-common-b1--min-medium\\\"\\n\\t\\tdata-js=\\\"tribe-events-view-link\\\"\\n\\t\\taria-label=\\\"Previous Events\\\"\\n\\t\\ttitle=\\\"Previous Events\\\"\\n\\t>\\n\\t\\t<svg\\n\\t class=\\\"tribe-common-c-svgicon tribe-common-c-svgicon--caret-left tribe-events-c-nav__prev-icon-svg\\\" \\taria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n\\tviewBox=\\\"0 0 10 16\\\"\\n\\txmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\"\\n>\\n\\t<path d=\\\"M9.7 14.4l-1.5 1.5L.3 8 8.2.1l1.5 1.5L3.3 8l6.4 6.4z\\\"\\/>\\n<\\/svg>\\n\\t\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-events-c-nav__prev-label\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\tPrevious <span class=\\\"tribe-events-c-nav__prev-label-plural tribe-common-a11y-visual-hide\\\">Events<\\/span>\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t<\\/a>\\n<\\/li>\\n\\n\\t\\t<